    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Yeah, but if we go to a purely rule-based system, we're going to lose a lot of the engagement metrics we've seen lately. Those \"nuanced\" decisions you make usually keep high-value users from getting frustrated with false positives. You think a rigid script can actually maintain the same level of platform health, or are we just accepting a drop in engagement to stay out of the news?",
